cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "SkyMatch: weather-aware Wallpaper Engine matcher for Windows"
message: "If you use SkyMatch in research or a derivative project, please cite it."
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: "Trzipx"
    given-names: "Trzipx"
repository-code: "https://github.com/zikTokito/SkyMatch"
url: "https://github.com/zikTokito/SkyMatch"
license: AGPL-3.0
version: "1.2.0"
date-released: "2026-10-21"
abstract: >-
  SkyMatch reads local weather and time of day, classifies Wallpaper Engine
  wallpapers with local CLIP/YOLO inference, and switches to a matching
  wallpaper while respecting fullscreen games, manual blocks, and age ratings.
keywords:
  - wallpaper-engine
  - weather
  - clip
  - onnx
  - winforms
  - desktop
